## Gemini website and dictation library (3 October 2026)

- Backend: gemini.google.com in an app-owned WKWebView session; no Codex auth or paid Gemini API key. The saved recording is replayed through the site microphone flow, then the composer transcript is read without sending a chat. This currently takes the audio duration again after recording stops. (3 October 2026)
- Cloud formatting submits text and the selected instruction to that same session; the dedicated Gemini model picker must match the configured visible model name. The site microphone transport is Google S3 SpeechDictationClient, intelligent-dictation. Its exact ASR model is not identified; never label it Gemini 3.5 Transcribe without new evidence. (3 October 2026)
- The native composer retains its 18 px text and fixed 860 by 140 frame. Hold Fn uses a nonactivating capsule; double Fn and Fn+Space enable hands-free, Control+D toggles recording, held Control+Shift+D invokes Command Mode, and Command+D retains composer dictation. Shortcuts, local engines, modes, prompts, tone, application rules, spelling context, history, CSV dictionary, replacements and snippets are editable in Library. (3 October 2026)
- Library.json, Audio and Pending share Application Support/ZenRayDictate/Library. Audio retention is off by default; text history remains available for reformatting. Pending recordings survive failures and restart for retry. Assets includes Library.json and optional Audio, excluding Pending and the Google profile. (3 October 2026)
- Installed Whisper large-v3-turbo transcribes the French witness offline. Installed Parakeet tdt_ctc-0.6b-ja transcribes a Japanese witness offline; no absent multilingual model is installed. Local-only skips Gemini and cloud formatting, applying vocabulary rules instead. Focused-window accessibility labels supply opt-in spelling context, capped at 6000 characters; full-screen OCR is not built. (3 October 2026)
- Real proofs: GeminiFlowProof.txt validates sequential website dictation and cleanup; the native app imports the witness and reprocesses it in clean mode while activeMode remains verbatim. FunctionalProof.json records these results, both local engine results, and audioRetained=false. Ten library tests, bridge rejection checks and signed bundle checks pass. (3 October 2026)
- Physical Fn press/release and automatic paste/clipboard restoration across the user's target apps remain manual validation limits. The implementation captures the original target and refuses a changed app, field, cursor or secure field; unreadable libraries preserve the original in Recovery. No benchmark is performed. (3 October 2026)
- Assets project ID is zenray-dictate; source IDs application, workshop, project-notes, historical-post and library. The cloud destination is pages/ZenRayAssets/zenray-dictate. Archive completion and immutable re-read are to be confirmed after the final checkpoint, rather than inferred from the local mapping. (3 October 2026)
